\title{Xavier Tolsa，定量可求长性、奇异积分与边值问题}
\date{2026-10-14}
\taxon{Reference}
\author{author}

\p{Xavier Tolsa，Interactions between Quantitative Rectifiability, Singular Integrals, and Boundary Value Problems for Harmonic Functions，Proceedings of the International Congress of Mathematicians 2026，卷 2，313–340 页。}
\p{[出版全文](https://epubs.siam.org/doi/full/10.1137/25M1804054)。第 3 节讨论平方函数，第 4 节讨论 Riesz 变换，第 5 节讨论可去奇点，第 6、7 节讨论调和测度与边值问题。}
